UR  - https://discover.lshtm.ac.uk/openurl/44HYG/44HYG_services_page?sid=OVID:embase&id=doi:&id=pmid&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2015&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Practices+and+Risk+Factors+for+Weaning+and+Extubation+Airway+Failure+in+Adult+Intensive+Care+Unit%3A+a+Multicenter+Trial&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT02450669%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
