T1  - A biophysical model of viral escape from polyclonal antibodies
A1  - Yu T.C.
A1  - Thornton Z.T.
A1  - Hannon W.W.
A1  - DeWitt W.S.
A1  - Radford C.E.
A1  - Matsen F.A.
