T1  - Use of pathological response versus RECIST assessment in predicting relapse-free survival following neoadjuvant immunotherapy for hepatocellular carcinoma
T3  - 2025 American Society of Clinical Oncology Gastrointestinal Cancers Symposium, ASCO 2025. San Francisco, CA United States.
