T1  - The synergy of tuf gene sequencing and maximum likelihood phylogenetic model: a suitable method for identifying the source of coagulase-negative staphylococci infections
A1  - Afeke I.
A1  - Adu-Amankwaah J.
A1  - Ankrah L.M.
A1  - Orish V.N.
A1  - Jamfaru I.
