T1  - Integrated single-cell and plasma proteomic modeling to predict surgical site complications, a prospective cohort study
T3  - International Anesthesia Research Society and Society of Critical Care Anesthesiologists 2022 Annual Meetings. Virtual.
A1  - Tsai A.S.
