T1  - Collaborative nowcasting of COVID-19 hospitalization incidences in Germany
A1  - Wolffram D.
A1  - Abbott S.
A1  - An Der Heiden M.
A1  - Funk S.
A1  - Gunther F.
A1  - Hailer D.
A1  - Heyder S.
