T1  - Non-Invasive Metabolite-Based Urine Signature Detects Over- Immunosuppression in Renal Transplant Recipients
T3  - 2022 American Transplant Congress, ATC 2022. Boston, MA United States.
A1  - Raghavendra Rao S.
A1  - Honrao C.
A1  - Rodrigues L.O.
