T1  - Cytokine levels and circulating DNA in plasma could be used as serological biomarkers of response to immunotherapy in hepatocellular carcinoma
T3  - The International Liver Congress. London United Kingdom.
A1  - Accarino E.V.
A1  - Higuera M.
A1  - Bermudez M.
A1  - Pons M.
