T1  - Prognostic impact of creatinine clearance using bioelectrical impedance analysis in heart failure: Comparison with cockcroft-gault, MDRD-4 and CKD-EPI formulas
T3  - 52nd Congress of the ItalianAssociation of Hospital Cardiologists, ANMCO 2021. Rimini Italy.
A1  - Scicchitano P.
A1  - Sanasi M.
A1  - Piscopo A.
A1  - Potenza A.
A1  - Pinto M.
