T1  - Interference of tumour mutational burden with outcome of patients with head and neck cancer treated with definitive chemoradiation: a multicentre retrospective study of the German Cancer Consortium Radiation Oncology Group
A1  - Eder T.
A1  - Hess A.K.
A1  - Konschak R.
A1  - Stromberger C.
A1  - Johrens K.
