T1  - TRIAGE study protocol-assessment of biomarkers to predict clinical worsening of patients with sepsis admitted in the emergency department
T3  - French Intensive Care Society International Congress - Reanimation 2019. Paris France.
A1  - Lafon T.
A1  - Vallejo C.
A1  - Barbier L.
A1  - Cazalis M.-A.
A1  - Daix T.
