T1  - Can disease "start" with perinatal light?-P LICCS Results in 190,000 live births from the international childhood cancer cohort consortium [I4C]
T3  - 31st Annual Meeting of the Society for Light Treatment and Biological Rhythms. Chicago, IL United States.
