T1  - Association of estimated glomerular filtration rate and proteinuria with all-cause mortality in community-based population in China: A Result from Kailuan Study
A1  - Wu J.
A1  - Jia J.
A1  - Li Z.
A1  - Pan H.
A1  - Wang A.
A1  - Guo X.
A1  - Wu S.
