T1  - Using paired serology and surveillance data to quantify dengue transmission and control during a large outbreak in Fiji
T3  - 67th Annual Meeting of the American Society of Tropical Medicine and Hygiene, ASTMH 2018. New Orleans, LA United States.
A1  - Kucharski A.
A1  - Kama M.
A1  - Watson C.
