T1  - Dietary antioxidant micronutrient intake and toxicity during remission induction in children with acute lymphoblastic leukemia (all): Results from dana-farber cancer institute (DFCI) all consortium trial 05-001
T3  - 59th Annual Meeting of the American Society of Hematology, ASH 2017. Atlanta, GA United States.
