T1  - Predictive accuracy of the veterans aging cohort study index for mortality with HIV infection: A north american cross cohort analysis
A1  - Justice A.C.
A1  - P. Modur S.
A1  - Tate J.P.
A1  - Althoff K.N.
A1  - Jacobson L.P.
A1  - Gebo K.A.
