T1  - Epidemiological trends of empirical or microbiologically documented treatment of chronic osteomyelitis. Results from a ten-year survey at a reference bone and joint infectious diseases department
T3  - 19th European Congress of Clinical Microbiology and Infectious Diseases (ECCMID). Helsinki Finland.
A1  - Giannitsioti E.
A1  - Papadopoulos A.
A1  - Athanasia S.
A1  - Koratzanis E.
